{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yXBZzFcYG31794636753.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美國太空探索技術公司SpaceX第15次試射「星艦」火箭，未能成功回收助推器。</p><p></p><p>「星艦」當地周五下午在得州發射場升空，兩分半鐘後火箭分離，「星艦」飛船成功進入軌道，釋放26枚「星鏈」衛星。飛船將繞行地球15圈，飛行約22小時後才重返地球。至於助推器未能回收，最終在墨西哥灣濺落爆炸。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.SPACEX-1330_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026N985sMZ0NM1794636846.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>這次「星艦」試射，原計劃飛船及助推器均重返發射場，以機械臂在半空夾取回收。SpaceX團隊指，會確認所有狀態正常，才會啟動飛船回收程序。</p><p></p><p>SpaceX創辦人馬斯克一直強調回收火箭的重要性，計劃在2027年上半年，達至每周都能發射「星艦」火箭。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T09:22:49.725104+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":263,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T05:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T09:36:18.131765+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T09:16:03.679879+00:00","content_hash":"4588a3b7df2e0aac22e50105afb6726efbaabee56f966055336b2a2939648ca6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T09:22:49.725104+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}